--- !u!114 &1574085315253164581
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 274685127869894913}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a433c9dfe9d7748d89a8ca1245488cff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestionDialogueTrigger
  introLines: []
  questionLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "You\u2019ll be a mazed at our number, eternal populations. We reside in
      darkest places, sewers, and stench filled oases. "
  - speaker: 1
    text: "But strange you see is our dilemma, for we\u2019re also found in turn,
      in the starkest, whitest, cleanest places, where people go to learn. What are
      we?"
  choices:
  - Rats
  - Germs
  - Humanity
  correctChoiceIndex: 0
  correctResponseLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: For the ward, a reward! Choose your poison, choose it well, for you a secret
      I will tell!
  - speaker: 1
    text: And by I, We mean Kai, the only rat not forced to dictate to placate, in
      rhyme all the time.
  incorrectResponseLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Someone must be going mad, or your intellect truly was a fad?
  currencyReward: 10
  autoStartOnEnable: 0
