--- !u!114 &2879772738472842323
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1750789661169068444}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a433c9dfe9d7748d89a8ca1245488cff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestionDialogueTrigger
  introLines: []
  questionLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "When in Rome\u2026five hundred begins it, five hundred ends it, Five in
      the middle is seen; First of all letters, the first of all figures, Take up
      their stations between."
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' Join all together, and then you will bring before you the name of an
      eminent king. Which ruler do we refer to?'
  choices:
  - Caesar
  - David
  - Minos
  correctChoiceIndex: 1
  correctResponseLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: For the ward, a reward! Choose your poison, choose it well, for you a secret
      I will tell!
  - speaker: 1
    text: And by I, We mean Kai, the only rat not forced to dictate to placate, in
      rhyme all the time.
  incorrectResponseLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Someone must be going mad, or your intellect truly was a fad?
  currencyReward: 10
  autoStartOnEnable: 0
