--- !u!114 &5425828042272870078
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8010600683872956113}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a433c9dfe9d7748d89a8ca1245488cff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestionDialogueTrigger
  introLines: []
  questionLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: We are The King.
  - speaker: 1
    text: A penny for your thoughts, a secret for your intellect.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Answer our riddles, these, and we\u2019ll share truths if you please."
  - speaker: 2
    text: So basically if I get it right, you tell me something in exchange.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Yes and yes, this is a test!
  - speaker: 1
    text: We are four brothers, bound to never grow closer. We shall run and run,
      but never reach each other. What are we?
  choices:
  - Siblings.
  - Wheels.
  - Atoms.
  correctChoiceIndex: 1
  correctResponseLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: For the ward, a reward! Choose your poison, choose it well, for you a secret
      I will tell!
  - speaker: 1
    text: And by I, We mean Kai, the only rat not forced to dictate to placate, in
      rhyme all the time.
  incorrectResponseLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Someone must be going mad, or your intellect truly was a fad?
  currencyReward: 10
  autoStartOnEnable: 0
